en:
Homestead Upgrade requires Grandeur Value, which can be obtained through managing production and earning revenue. Once maxed out, excess Grandeur Value can be stored and will be carried over at a 50% ratio to the next level.
Obtain Grandeur Value via the following methods:
1. Exploration output, complete News;
2. Produce and sell goods;
3. Recruit and develop Crafters;
4. Complete Gold-Making Vessel orders;
5. Complete Chapter Objective quests;
6. Upgrade Serene Abode Industry.

zh:
撩湖喵曰：
西湖之美，在乎山色空蒙、风荷摇曳。
若投箧落滓，则清波蒙尘，是为不仁;
若轻身一跃、涉险跳湖，则性命堪忧，是为不智;
若攀折芙蕖、私据春色，则是暴殄天物，是大煞风景。

凡此种种，皆有违风雅，更为吴越禁律所不容，诸位当引以为戒喵！

en:
Lake Dredging Meow says:
West Lake's beauty lies in mist-veiled hills and lotus leaves swaying in the breeze.
To cast rubbish into its clear waters is unkind;
To leap recklessly into the lake and risk your life is unwise;
To pluck its lotus blooms and take their beauty for yourself is wasteful and spoils the scenery.

All such acts violate elegance and Wuyue's prohibitions. Everyone should take heed, meow!

1. During the event, complete 1 quest to gain 1 upgrade attempt;
2. Spend upgrade attempts to gradually improve rewards. Flip the card to claim the highest current tier reward;
3. You can flip the card to claim rewards after Oct 11, 05:00. Rewards can only be claimed once. Cannot upgrade after flipping;

zh:
 十二月初七 滹沱北岸     
 辰时一刻（07:00）           
 //切换显示到北岸一处战场，杜重威派人送来了虎符。     
 //周围是将士拼死搏杀的景象，王清也伤痕累累。     
 //操纵王清，砍杀几个契丹怪。     
王清 耳鸣声。喘气声。     
 //砍怪完成后，触发相应剧情。     
无名将士1 将军！大营来人了！     
 //王清气喘吁吁。天泉侠士们散开包围圈，中间是个传令兵。传令兵抱着一口盒子，盒子正是丁笑那边盒子的样式。     
王清 （喘气声）     
传令兵 末将拜见将军，大帅差末将，送虎符至此，并有一言，谓将军。     
传令兵 大帅说，答允将军的援军已到，还请将军珍重。     
 //众天泉侠客面面相觑，周围没有援军。控制王清去接过盒子，周围是天泉弟子的声音。     
无名将士2 援军？哪来的援军？     
无名将士3 满口胡言！此地光你一人，何来援军？！     
无名将士4 你说啊，援军在哪？     
 //王清耳鸣声和眩晕滤镜加重，可以操纵王清走向传令兵。周围是将士们的呼喊声，模糊不清。     
无名将士5 该死！这些虏人杀都杀不完。     
无名将士6 将军，两翼、两翼失守啦！     
无名将士7 护住中军，再与死战！     
无名将士8 杀——！     
 //走到指定地点，播放镜头对话，王清的一只手，向盒子抓去。     
 //戛然而止，切镜。

en:
 December 7th, North Bank of the Hutuo River     
 7:15 AM (07:00)           
 //Scene transitions to a battlefield on the north bank. Du Zhongwei has sent someone with the tiger tally.     
 //The surroundings show soldiers fighting desperately, and Wang Qing is also covered in wounds.     
 //Control Wang Qing to slay several Khitan monsters.     
Wang Qing (Ringing in ears. Heavy breathing.)     
 //After defeating the monsters, trigger the corresponding cutscene.     
Nameless Soldier 1 General! Someone from the main camp has arrived!     
 //Wang Qing pants heavily. The Well of Heaven Swordsmen disperse their encirclement, revealing a messenger in the center. The messenger holds a box, identical in style to the one from Ding Xiao's side.     
Wang Qing (Heavy breathing)     
Messenger I pay my respects, General. The Marshal has sent me to deliver the tiger tally and relay a message for you.     
Messenger The Marshal says the reinforcements promised to you have arrived. He urges you to take care.     
 //The Well of Heaven Heroes exchange puzzled glances—there are no reinforcements in sight. Control Wang Qing to take the box as the voices of Well of Heaven Disciples echo around.     
Nameless Soldier 2 Reinforcements? Where are they?     
Nameless Soldier 3 Nonsense! You're the only one here—what reinforcements?!     
Nameless Soldier 4 Speak! Where are the reinforcements?     
 //Wang Qing's ear ringing and dizziness intensify. Players can control Wang Qing to approach the messenger. The shouts of soldiers around grow indistinct.     
Nameless Soldier 5 Damn it! These barbarians just keep coming!     
Nameless Soldier 6 General, both flanks—both flanks have fallen!     
Nameless Soldier 7 Protect the center! Fight to the death!     
Nameless Soldier 8 Charge—!     
 //Upon reaching the designated spot, a cutscene plays. Wang Qing's hand reaches for the box.     
 //Abrupt cut to black.

